 `interface/editors/`.  😢\r\n\r\n<img width=\"872\" height=\"162\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1bea25a-3f1f-4c87-9b93-9295b0bdcab5\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nIt's only used in `SceneTreeDock::attach_script_to_selected`, but all of its fellow scene tree dock editor settings are in `docks/scene_tree/`.\r\nAnd it's been all alone ever since https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116940.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"882\" height=\"456\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9376b186-3ef0-4629-865e-53fdfdcbf63b\" />\r\n\r\nNow they are together and there is no need for the Interface / Editors category! 🥰\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`interface/editors/derive_script_globals_by_name` moved to `docks/scene_tree/derive_script_globals_by_name`","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_u